{"ref":"character:ameya-aisling","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Diva_No._5.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Emerald Diorama)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Ameya Aisling is a playable character from the Emerald Diorama DLC of Vampire Survivors. Her starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Spirit_Rings.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spirit-rings"}," ",{"t":"Spirit Rings","r":"weapon:spirit-rings"},". She can also pick ",{"i":"Sprite-Intuition.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:intuition"}," ",{"t":"Intuition","r":"weapon:intuition"}," as a starting weapon (which needs to be unlocked)."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["10 April 2025 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Ameya"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["EME_MAGICALL"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["EME_CharacterControllerAmeya"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Spirit_Rings.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:spirit-rings"}," ",{"t":"Spirit Rings","r":"weapon:spirit-rings"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Fully evolving the ",{"i":"Sprite-Twin_Dragon.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:twin-dragon"}," ",{"t":"Twin Dragon","r":"weapon:twin-dragon"}]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 5,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Emerald_Diorama.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Yumeha, Chipper as Ever! - VS version\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+20%"]]},{"label":"Reroll","cells":[["+5"]]},{"label":"Skip","cells":[["+5"]]},{"label":"Banish","cells":[["+5"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Ameya Aisling can be unlocked by fully evolving the ",{"i":"Sprite-Twin_Dragon.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:twin-dragon"}," ",{"t":"Twin Dragon","r":"weapon:twin-dragon"}," (into ",{"i":"Sprite-Gekkabijin.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:gekkabijin"}," ",{"t":"Gekkabijin","r":"weapon:gekkabijin"},", then maxing it to level 6)."]},{"k":"p","c":["Evolving ",{"i":"Sprite-Spirit_Rings.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spirit-rings"}," ",{"t":"Spirit Rings","r":"weapon:spirit-rings"}," unlocks ",{"i":"Sprite-Intuition.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:intuition"}," ",{"t":"Intuition","r":"weapon:intuition"}," as her optional starting weapon."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Ameya Aisling can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"yumehaizumi\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Ameya Aisling starts with +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", +5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:reroll"}," ",{"t":"Reroll","r":"powerup:reroll"},", +5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Skip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:skip"}," ",{"t":"Skip","r":"powerup:skip"},", and +5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Depending on Ameya's level, more cats will spawn at a higher frequency:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["From Lvl. 1 to Lvl. 20, 1 cat spawns every 5 s."]},{"c":["From Lvl. 21 to Lvl. 40, 2 cats spawn every 5 s."]},{"c":["From Lvl. 41 to Lvl. 60, 2 cats spawn every 4 s."]},{"c":["From Lvl. 61 to Lvl. 80, 3 cats spawn every 4 s."]},{"c":["After Lvl. 81, 3 cats spawn every 3 s."]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Ameya Aisling gains stat bonuses when collecting her summoned cats. The stat bonuses from the cats are:"]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"